        {
          "text": "Azeezi nzezyaabilo bana ba-Israyeli nzebakavuba munyika ya-Kanana, nzebakaabilwa kuliba-Eleazara mupaizi a-Joshua mwana wa-Nuni abasilutwe bamikowa yabana ba-Israyeli. ",
