        {
          "text": "Nkaambo bana ba-Josefa kabali misyobo yobile, nkukuti Manase a-Efraimu, aboobo teewakaabila bana ba-Levi caabilo niciba comwe, cita minzi yakukala, anyika iibambene ayo yakucezezya iŋombe zyabo ambono zyabo. ",
