        {
          "text": "Elyo bana ba-Juda bakaswena kuli Joshua mu-Giligala, nkabela Kalebe mwana wa-Jefune mu-Kenezi wakamwaambila kuti, Ulizi Jehova mbwaakaambila Musa muntu wa-Leza makani esu, mebo ayebo, nitwakali ku-Kadesi­-Barinea. ",
          "type": "text",
