        {
          "text": "Ndakali amyaka iili makumi one, ciindi ceiya Musa mulanda wa-Jehova naakandituma kuzwa ku-Kadesi-Barinea kuyoolanga-langa nyika, nkabela ndakamuboozezya makani aakali mumoyo wangu, ",
