        {
          "text": "Lino Musa wakandikonkezya mubuzuba obo kuti, Ncobeni nyika eyo iilyatidwe amaulu aako iyooba caabilo cako acabana bako ciindi coonse kukabe kutamani, nkaambo moyo wako woonse waubika kuli-Jehova Leza wako, ",
