        {
          "text": "Lino sunu bona! Jehova wandiponya mbubonya mbwaakaamba, eyi myaka iili makumi one amusanu, kuzwa kuciindi eciya Jehova naakaambila Musa majwi aya, bana ba-Israyeli nibakali kukala-kala munkanda, kusikila sunu, Buzuba obuno ndili amyaka iili makumi aali musanu aatatu iili amusanu. ",
