        {
          "text": "Lino kondipa eci cilundu, Jehova ncaakaamba mubuzuba obo, nkaambo wakaswiilila kuciindi eco nciconya ba-Anaki mbubakede mulincico, bali aminzi mi pati iizyungulukidwe bulambo. Ambweni Jehova uyooba ambe, aboobo njoobatanda, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakaamba.",
