              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobo munzi wa-Hebroni mbuwakaba caabilo ca-Kalebe mwana wa-Jefune mu-Kenezi, nguucivubide asunu, nkaambo wakatobela Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli camoyo woonse. ",
          "type": "text",
